data_ZIF62_ordered_unitcell
_audit_creation_method           'converted from the ordered MD model used in this work'
_publ_section_comment
;
Ordered (P1) model of crystalline ZIF-62, Zn(Im)1.75(bIm)0.25, used to build the
2x2x1 and 2x2x2 supercells of the MD simulations. Derived from CSD deposition 2130183
(doi:10.5517/ccdc.csd.cc29hml1) by resolving the crystallographic disorder into one
ordered arrangement with 28 Im and 4 bIm linkers per 16 Zn (296 atoms).
;
